      "writtenOn": "2024-01-22T09:01:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "but actually, this CL in itself seems fine and actually seems useful/necessary as well. Apps that request Thread networks won\u0027t need to specify it (except if they want to run only on BRs, where the thread network is local) but it will still be useful to include this capability in local networks for general information purposes.\n\nWith that, LGTM assuming the javadoc is fixed.",
